OL,3,GNEWSAAsda worker learns midwifery after
OL,4,Acar park birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA supermarket worker who helped a dad
OL,7,Fdeliver a baby in a car park has gone
OL,8,Fon to become a qualified midwife, after
OL,9,Fbeing inspired by the experience.
OL,11,FCharmaine Taylor, 28, was walking out
OL,12,Fof the Asda store in Ipswich with a
OL,13,Fcolleague six years ago when they heard
OL,14,Fsome noises, which sounded like someone
OL,15,Fin pain.
OL,17,FThey then discovered a woman in labour
OL,18,Fin the back of a car and sprung into
OL,19,Faction.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
