OL,3,GNEWSAAsda worker learns midwifery after
OL,4,Acar park birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor said she sat on the phone while
OL,7,Fthey waited for an ambulance, and
OL,8,Fencouraged the woman's partner to
OL,9,Fdeliver the baby. "It reinforced my
OL,10,Fdesire to pursue a profession where I
OL,11,Fcan advocate for women. It was just a
OL,12,Fbeautiful moment," she said.
